# ==========================================================
#  GOVERNANCE EVIDENCE / PROVENANCE BASELINE PRIVACY (TD-AXIOM-GIT-PROVENANCE)
#  Evidence is a review input, not permanent source-of-record material.
#  Already-tracked files require an explicit `git rm --cached` during the
#  authorized baseline staging procedure; ignore rules alone do not untrack.
# ==========================================================
docs/evidence/**
**/OPERATOR_RESULTS*.md
**/*_OPERATOR_RESULTS*.md
**/UI-*_RAW_*.json
scripts/*_evidence*.ps1
**/*_RAW_*.json
